    {
      "id": "D01",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "若叶墨",
      "text": "yield 会暂停，for await 也会等待……\n它们是同一种写法吗？到底是谁在等谁？",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 218,
      "y": 244,
      "width": 958,
